  "contentHtml": "<p>한국과학창의재단에서</p><p>과학실험안전과 관련된</p><p>좋은 자료들을 만들어 주셨네요!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51c88b936e61a22b1a663c960bc4f0b49dbf2387\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51c88b936e61a22b1a663c960bc4f0b49dbf2387\" data-origin-width=\"736\" data-origin-height=\"417\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>해당 파일들을 다운 받으시려면</p><p>아래 사이트의&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #f89009;\">&#160;학습자료실 - 실험안전&#160;</span> </b>메뉴 입니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/body/archive/all/main.do\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/body/archive/all/main.do</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"지능형 과학실 ON\" data-og-description=\"지능형 과학실 ON\" data-og-host=\"science-on.kosac.re.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/body/archive/all/main.do\" data-og-url=\"https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/KhI6G/hyZGau9WXG/OyaeboAWxOvJFUWFKYcuJK/img.png?width=1280&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1280_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/chWosk/hyZGnH4gye/312z8yR7JQoIDVkzQHzxZk/img.png?width=1450&amp;height=249&amp;face=0_0_1450_249,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/F2xNz/hyZGnnLCY5/c6mpGtd6ZEdlNYYMWuSr01/img.png?width=590&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_590_360\"><a href=\"https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/body/archive/all/main.do\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://science-on.kosac.re.kr/body/archive/all/main.do\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/KhI6G/hyZGau9WXG/OyaeboAWxOvJFUWFKYcuJK/img.png?width=1280&amp;height=600&amp;face=0_0_1280_600,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/chWosk/hyZGnH4gye/312z8yR7JQoIDVkzQHzxZk/img.png?width=1450&amp;height=249&amp;